{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別の服 ↓マネキンさんが着てたから買ったのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は個別握手会来て下さってありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい時間を一緒に過ごせてとっても幸せでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事におうちに着いたかな!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでもらえてたら嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はゆみ姉にも逢えて嬉しい気持ちと寂しかった気持ちとあったけど\n笑顔で最後まで一緒にいたいと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手の写メリクエストの方ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもぶれてしまいました\nごめんちゃい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日は\n今レッスン終わってアンダーメンバーでご飯食べに行きました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでオーディション受けたのかとか、将来の夢とか色々なお話をたっぷりしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず皆話が長いので........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店の方！\nすみません\nそして、めっちゃメニュー頼んですみません\nそしてそして、お水何回も注ぎに来てくださりありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の後、\n能條アミちゃん\n川後ひなちゃん\n樋口ひなちゃん\n斎藤ちはるちゃん\n私の五人で渋谷デートしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでもまた、ご飯食べたんだけどね\nBIGNEWS"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カエル＆メダカを食べたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通に、たこ焼きとかアイスとか食べてたんだけどー........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが、パンと他のもの食べようとして、店員さん呼んで、たのみ終わったら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條\n『まあやメダカ食べなよ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"樋口、川後、斎藤\n『食べなって〜笑』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店員\n『めっちゃ美味しいですよ！\n私はカエルの方が好きですけど......』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田...\n『そのカエルとかメダカって本物ですか？偽物ですか？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと店員さんに聞くと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店員\n『本物ですよ！笑』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ.........汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條\n『じゃぁメダカとカエルで！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとなって、メダカ＆カエルを食べるようになりました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このお店は不思議な昭和なお店でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと最初、抵抗あって、\nもうもろ本物で...汗汗\n怖かったんですけど、みんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ほら食べなよ〜！爆笑』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなって、\n食べました〜！笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも川後ひなちゃんと斎藤ちはるちゃんは食べなかったです！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄い体験をしました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りの電車では能條さんが見事に私の顔面に\nくしゃみとばしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(しょっちゅうやられます！ちなみに被害者は何人もメンバーにおります)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとアミアミの愛情表現だと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ちはるんはよく人を誉めてくれるいい人なの！\n今日も、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まあやは太陽の娘みたいだね』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれたよ！\nまあやは、そんな事を言えるちはるんは\n心もキレイな女性だな〜って思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、食事の後は、せいたんとカラオケに行ったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑松村さゆり＆白石まいやん＆和田まあや＆生駒りな様でーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の\n個別握手会は朝早いのに来てくださって本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝会場に行ったらスタッフさんのとこにスケートボード！？があったの、\n案の定、皆でのりまわしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お客さんの会場の方に勢い余って行ったメンバーもいたよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまだお客さん居なかったからよかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、握手中、\n名前を教えてくれたり、\nまあやTシャツ着てくださった方も居たり\n服の後ろにマアヤの名前を入れて、ワザワザ作ってくださったり、団扇があったり......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしー気持ちだったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして岡山でのイベント来てくださる方もいて、これまたうれしー気持ちでハッピーですー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログコメントで、行けないけど頑張って〜!!って応援してくださって、ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも心強いですよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岡山は\n地元近くだから家族も来るからドキドキですー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんもファンに会えるからうれしいがるよーきっと...どこかで泣いてるかも..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ロッティーからと、せっちゃんから服もらったの〜！わ〜い！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい気持ちっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人ともオシャレでセンスもいいからね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにロッティーちゃんは、この前まあやの学校行事に親代わりで来てくれました...とっても嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、それを聞いたお母さんは又泣いてました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は、せっちゃんとトマトお姉ちゃんも来たい！って行ってくれたんだけどこれなくて......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、その気持ちが まあやにはとっても嬉しかったんだ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3085673/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}